#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:160
msgid "When enabled, disable any other rotation than the up axis. Only works when animating position with Rotate Along Path enabled. Use this to prevent object twisting/flipping while following the path. Only works if Rotate Along Path is enabled"
msgstr "启用后，禁用除上轴以外的任何旋转。仅在使用沿路径旋转并动画位置时有效。用于防止物体沿路径时扭转/翻转。仅在启用沿路径旋转时有效"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:185
msgid "When enabled, rotation will not go over 360 degrees, and instead mapped to 0. Only applicable for object with euler rotation."
msgstr "启用后，旋转不会超过 360 度，而是映射到 0。仅适用于使用欧拉旋转的物体。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:153
msgid "When enabled, script will attempt to fix rotation based off the track axis direction. This is to ensure object always facing forward the path. Only works if Rotate Along Path is enabled."
msgstr "启用后，脚本将尝试根据跟踪轴方向修正旋转。以确保物体始终朝向路径前方。仅在启用沿路径旋转时有效。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:170
msgid "When enabled, the script will attempt to fix rotation that cause flip by negating the rotation."
msgstr "启用后，脚本将尝试通过反转旋转来修正导致翻转的旋转。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:30
msgid "When turned on, 3D cursor will be set depending on the first item in target list. Does not work for pose bones when using \"Selected\"."
msgstr "开启后，将根据目标列表中的第一项设置 3D 光标。使用「已选择」时不适用于姿态骨骼。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:66
msgid "When turned on, annotation/grease pencil current keyframe or curve object will be removed after applying animation"
msgstr "开启后，应用动画后将移除标注/蜡笔当前关键帧或曲线物体"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:91
msgid "When turned on, initial rotation will be added in addition to the trajectory rotation path. Otherwise the rotation will be set to whatever is given based off the settings."
msgstr "开启后，将在轨迹旋转路径之外额外添加初始旋转。否则旋转将根据设置设定为指定值。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:84
msgid "When turned on, position will be relative to their current position and the trajectory. Otherwise the position will snap to the trajectory position."
msgstr "开启后，位置将相对于其当前位置和轨迹。否则位置将吸附到轨迹位置。"

#: properties/stroke_panel_props.py:7
msgid "When turned on, stroke will not be removed after converting into curve. Otherwise the active frame will be removed after conversion."
msgstr "开启后，转换为曲线后不会移除笔划。否则转换后将移除当前帧。"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:72
msgid "When turned on, target animation will rotate along trajectory path"
msgstr "开启后，目标动画将沿轨迹路径旋转"

#: properties/trajectanim_panel_props.py:78
msgid "When turned on, trajectory path will be reversed"
msgstr "开启后，轨迹路径将被反转"

#: properties/stroke_panel_props.py:32
